      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is a bit of a misuse of the whole concept of compatible: it\u0027s basically using it as a label (as in: there\u0027s going to be exactly one instance of each). It would certainly work but at this point, would it make more sense to use a label or alias instead? That would also ensure uniqueness and remove the overhead of having to define a bunch of bindings.",
