      "writtenOn": "2021-03-24T13:58:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "would it make sense if we used \"nuvoton,npcx-i2c-port\" instead to initialize all of them?\n\nbut should probably remove \"npcx-\" from the name so this can be common code...",
      "parentUuid": "e9783732_e6392bf4",
